@baseUrl = http://localhost:8080/api/v1
@accessToken = paste-student-access-token-here

### 1. Log in as a verified student, then paste accessToken above
POST {{baseUrl}}/auth/login
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "email": "student@example.com",
  "password": "strong-password",
  "device": "vnpay-sandbox-test"
}

### 2. Create a VNPay sandbox payment URL for the student's approved monthly route
POST {{baseUrl}}/students/me/payments/vnpay-url
Authorization: Bearer {{accessToken}}
Content-Type: application/json

{}

### 3. After opening paymentUrl in a browser, pay with VNPay sandbox card
# Bank: NCB
# Card: 9704198526191432198
# Issue date: 07/15
# CVV: 123
# OTP: 123456

### 4. Check payment/invoice status after VNPay redirects back
GET {{baseUrl}}/students/me/payments
Authorization: Bearer {{accessToken}}

### 5. Check active monthly pass and QR after successful payment
GET {{baseUrl}}/students/me/tickets
Authorization: Bearer {{accessToken}}
